<title>FRANCE: Essilor 1996 sales up 19.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Essilor 1996 sales up 19.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover		 7,828 vs 6,538 (+19.7 percent)</p>
<p>NOTE : Essilor said in a statement published in French newspapers that turnover rose 5.4 percent at constant structure and exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
